# Things the image must not carry.
#
# The database and its backups are deliberately excluded: they are the history and
# they belong on the mounted volume, not baked into a layer. `.env` holds the
# Akahu tokens and the ntfy topic, and is passed in at run time instead.
data/
backups/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Raw Akahu captures: redacted, but they still hold real balances.
fixtures/akahu-accounts.spike-*.json
fixtures/akahu-accounts.real.json

node_modules/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
dist/
.git/
.gitignore
*.log
docs/
tests/
.hermes/